@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Tes server
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Buat notes
POST {{baseUrl}}/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Catatan Pertama","body":"Belajar CRUD PostgreSQL","tags":["belajar"]}

### Ambil semua notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes

### Registrasi (bonus)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"andi123","password":"passwordRahasia123","fullname":"Andi Saputra"}

### Untuk GET/PUT/DELETE per ID, ganti ID sesuai respons POST /notes
GET {{baseUrl}}/notes/ISI_ID_DI_SINI
